Revision history for Test-Mutation

0.001
    - First release.
    - Mutants are served to the test process through an @INC hook, and no source file is rewritten.
    - Tests are selected by a built-in line trace, run fastest first, and stopped at the first failure.
    - Reports: terminal summary, JSON in the mutation-testing-report-schema, single-file HTML, GitHub annotations.
    - Commands: run, list, show, exec, merge, mutators.
    - The tests run in copies of the project, so the project keeps its files and each mutant starts from one state.
